# Gleeful Demolition on Bot1's own Darksteel Citadel: indestructible, so it is not destroyed (CR 702.12b), but Bot1
# controlled that artifact, so the three Goblins are still made (the ruling: a legal target that isn't destroyed still
# gives the tokens). Each token is a 1/1 red Phyrexian Goblin creature: its toughness, card type and subtypes are pinned.

[Bot1 Deck]
Darksteel Citadel
Mox Ruby
Gleeful Demolition
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Darksteel Citadel.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Gleeful Demolition.Cast(Darksteel Citadel)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Goblin Token#2.Toughness = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Goblin Token#2.Types = Creature
? Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Goblin Token#2.Subtypes = Goblin; Phyrexian

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Darksteel Citadel; Mox Ruby; Phyrexian Goblin Token; Phyrexian Goblin Token; Phyrexian Goblin Token
Bot1.Graveyard = Gleeful Demolition
